#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"So, we're officially assassins for hire now.  How do you feel about that?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Well, now we're radio technicians.  Sounds fun, don't you think?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"What do you make of these weird pictographs?  I think they're directions "
"somewhere."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Where do you think we can get some anesthetic for that robot guy?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Any thoughts on this scouting mission, checking out this bunker thing?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"How do you think we should start looking for this lost interdimensional "
"building?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "You ready to go burn some shit down?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "It's not gonna be a problem that we're hunting down Foodperson, is it?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "What do you think about clearing out these pizzeria squatters?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "So, cake and a party.  Think it was all worth it?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "What do you think, you in the mood to hunt some slimes?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Hey Liam!  Liam!  Bughunt!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Looks like I've got you doing deliveries again.  Where should we look for all"
" this lumber?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I dunno if you heard, but guess what we're gonna deliver now?  More lumber!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Any idea where we can find some ropes?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "These guys need a wood saw.  You carrying one?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Where could we find a shovel?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "We're looking for a charcoal smoker now.  You seen one?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"This guy wants us to find a Remington 870 Express for a client.  You know a "
"bit about that stuff, don't you?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Nothing ever went wrong tracking down a nice old guy in a cabin in the woods,"
" right?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "You fine with helping this guy and his rabbits?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Does blackberry hunting sound nice?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Mind helping Mr. Lapin get in touch with his friends?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Seen an anvil around recently?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Anything we should consider before trying to find Chris Isherwood?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Looks like Barry Isherwood's got himself into some trouble."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Want to help me collect some dandelions?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Hey Liam.  Bee balm?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Tonight, on 'to catch a predator'…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Eddie wants a *lot* of rocks."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "So, Liam, you ready to gather sand?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "I told Eddie we'd help him gather some clay."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Where should we look for jars for the Isherwoods?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Any thoughts about looking for wheat seeds?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Liam, you're not afraid of the big bad wolf, are you?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "What do you think about hunting some mystery monsters for Jesse?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Hey, you ever seen a book about glassblowing?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Luke Isherwood wants a copy of the DIY Compendium."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "You think Barry's gonna be okay?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Liam!  There's a chef, trapped in a restaurant!  Want to help save them?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"What do you think about tracking down these survivors camping out on a farm?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Should we go track down this mystery cabin?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Liam, I've got the location of a prepper bunker.  Should we check this out?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "How do you feel about checking out a zombie-infested farm?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Sweet, road trip!  That sounds like as good a plan as any, my friend.  Gives "
"me some first season Walking Dead vibes, you know?  Maybe the place will be "
"run by sinister G-men, or a lone crazy scientist who thinks he can cure "
"zombies if he can just get his hands on one super-rare ingredient.  Road "
"trip!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Road trip!  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I'm thinking this kinda sounds like that intercom and their vague-yet-"
"menacing government agency.\"  He pauses.  \"That might be a deep cut, if you"
" never listened to Night Vale.  Anyway, I bet that's where we're going."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I'm thinking this sounds *awesome*, and also possibly we're gonna die.  At "
"least we'll die investigating a vague-yet-menacing government agency.\"  He "
"pauses.  \"That might be a deep cut, if you never listened to Night Vale."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Yep, same page.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"*rubs his chin thoughtfully.  \"Maybe we can set up a bottleneck in the "
"hallway?  First we drag a few lockers or something to funnel them, then one "
"of us hangs close to the barricade and the other stands back and fires arrows"
" or something?\"  He shrugs.  \"I'm not great at tactics, and I'm a bit "
"nervous about what's back there.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Thanks man.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"You sure we haven't bit off more than we can chew here?\"  He stares at you "
"for a moment.  \"This isn't DOTA2, this is real life.  These guys are gonna "
"have guns and shit.  I know we've been through a lot together but if they're "
"ready for us they could take us out before we're even close enough to see "
"them.  I mean, I'm with you if you think we can do it, but be careful, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Thanks man, I'll keep that in mind.  We gotta do this though.  Any "
"suggestions for how to do it safely?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Thanks man, I'll keep that in mind.  We'll do this carefully.  I'd like your "
"opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"If you're gonna insist on it then I say we drive up quick in the dark, take "
"cover behind the car, and make a ton of noise.  Then we take cover and when "
"they come to check things out, we pick them off.  Or maybe we come in silent,"
" from a distance, and take out their sentries.  A bow is great for that, if "
"we can make the shots.  This whole thing still seems ridiculous though."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I'm kinda looking forward to it.  It's good to see people already building up"
" something to last, after everything that's gone down.  Wonder what we'll "
"find out there."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"That's optimistic, thanks man.  I'd like your opinion on something else, "
"actually."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"You know, I read an article about how those stupid FEMA evac shelters all had"
" solar power for emergencies.  I bet nobody's looting those, let's track some"
" down and unbolt 'em."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Not a bad thought.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Look, you're the one that agreed to this.  I don't know why you keep agreeing"
" to this stuff.  Maybe we can check hardware stores?  Or just eat a lot of "
"jarred food, and keep the empties?  A hundred jars.  That's a lot, my "
"friend.\"  He shakes his head.  \"You don't have to agree to do *everything* "
"people ask you to do, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Your objection is noted.  I'd like your opinion on something else, though."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"*shakes his head at you.  \"Look, you asked last time, and I told you you "
"didn't have to keep taking jobs like this.  Now you're asking again?  *I "
"dunno, stop offering to bring a billion jars to people if you don't know "
"where to find them.*\"  He laughs.  \"I'm just messing with you.\"  His eyes "
"narrow.  \"Or am I?\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"How about it?  Seems like a nice enough thing to do I guess.  I bet plenty of"
" zombies are carrying smokes, and there's probably tons in people's abandoned"
" cars."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Yeah.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Isn't he just directing us out to that Isherwood farm?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Sounds good.  I'm a bit nervous about what we might find, though.  Who knows "
"what the apocalypse would do to a bunch of gun-toting back country folks?  On"
" the other hand, maybe they're sweet, salt-of-the-earth types.  Only one way "
"to find out!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Right.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Is that just that Hub place, with the intercom?  Not that it's not cool, but "
"it's nothing new to us.  Woah… we've really seen some shit, haven't we."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"It sounds to me like this might be that intercom we found out in that weird "
"building?  I'm just guessing.  We should go confirm."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Hell yeah, this sounds so badass!  Let's be careful though, 'secret lab' "
"sounds like a place that's gonna have some defenses."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "You bet.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"We've been there, remember?  It's got those cyborg guys, the cockney ones."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Far-fetched and awesome!  Let's go see.  Maybe it's an abandoned theme park "
"or something."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "We've been there, remember"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "?  Cody, the blacksmith, she's the food lady"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"?  I'm guessing the blacksmith we didn't talk to is the one who would have "
"fed us"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ", and Jay is the one with the weird bullet bank."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ", and the other guy there must be the one with the bullet bank."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I'm open to anything if it means getting fed.  Ugh, unless it's unidentified "
"meat.  I guess we have to be more careful of strangers than we used to.  "
"Still, let's find out."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Well, I like his fashion choices, but he, um.  Well, you know.  You met him."
"  I don't mind helping him out, in theory, but I don't know if bringing him "
"piles of trash is really going to do anyone any good.  The Merchants might "
"think it's a fire hazard."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Let's try it out anyway.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Right, I guess.  I don't quite get why you're doing this stuff for him, he's "
"probably just going to keep piling up the stuff and not doing anything with "
"it.\"  He shrugs.  \"On the other hand, maybe he'll make a kick-ass box fort,"
" I'd be all about that."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "That's my hope.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I'm telling you, this is just going to go on and on forever.\"  He looks sad."
"  \"I'd really love to see him get a cool box fort and feel better, but I "
"think we're just enabling his delusions, my friend."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Let's see this through a bit longer.  I'd like your opinion on something "
"else."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I gotta admit, this one surprised me.  I take back some of what I said "
"earlier, I'm just confused now.  Let's see where it goes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Right?  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"It had better be!  I'm not sure why you're doing this, but I do think it's "
"good you're trying to help him.  Maybe we should stop eventually though?\"  "
"He sighs.  \"I don't know what to make of Dave.  I worked with a guy with "
"schizophrenia back at Foodplace, and Dave is nothing like that.  I don't know"
" if he's actually got some kind of mental illness or if it's a stress "
"reaction or something.  He doesn't act like any real person I've ever met, "
"and we got all kinds of strung-out types there."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "That's good insight.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Well, I'm definitely interested to see where it goes.  I hope it helps Dave "
"somehow.  I don't know what's going on with him except that it's nothing like"
" any schizophrenia or anything like that I've ever seen, and I've seen "
"practically anything you can imagine, working service."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "I have a good feeling.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Well, it probably isn't going to come back alive.  They ooze blood "
"everywhere, when we fight 'em.  It's kinda thicker and goopier than human "
"blood, but I guess not so bad it'd be hard to draw?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Thanks.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"This sounds *nuts* man.  How are we going to get in and out alive?  A place "
"like that is going to be crawling with zombies and who knows what else.\"  He"
" shudders.  \"Let's be careful, right?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Okay.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"This was a total surprise to everyone,\" he grumbles.  \"Still, this can't be"
" any worse than getting the first analysis done, right?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Let's hope not.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"&He grins.  \"I'm gonna level with you, this sounds incredibly *cool*.\"  He "
"laughs at his own joke.  \"Seriously though, it's probably going to be a "
"really tricky one"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
".  It'd be good to maybe try cybernetics to help us with the cold, they won't"
" be as bulky and confining to fight in as winter gear."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ".  We'll need to bundle up extra toasty, that'll make fighting tough."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Good thoughts.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Compared to what we've done, this doesn't sound so bad.  Creepy as heck "
"though.  We should tell ghost stories on the way."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I mean, I have a basic understanding of the principles.  We could also see if"
" we could just find a couple stills though, we're not far from the mountains."
"  I bet every second farm's gonna have a moonshine still set up in one of the"
" sheds."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Good point, although really, how hard can it be to make one?  I'd like your "
"opinion on something else, too."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I think a supermarket might be the *yeast* likely place to find it!\"  He "
"watches your expression for a moment, then shrugs.  \"Worth a shot.  Anyway, "
"as far as I know, dry yeast lasts practically forever.  Should be able to "
"find some of it anywhere people did baking or brewing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Thanks, man.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Those Tacoma folks really think about sustainability, hey?  I like that.  Buy"
" local, you know?  I got no idea where to find sugar beet seeds though.  I "
"don't remember having any stocked at the cabin.  Maybe a farm or farm supply "
"store would have them?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"*laughs.  \"If we track these things down for the bartender, I hope we get a "
"nice, sincere 'tanks' at the end.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Me too.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"There's only one way for two folks like us to transport two huge liquid "
"storage drums.  We bundle ourselves in them and roll them down the hill.  "
"First one to the bar buys the other one a drink."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"You know it'd be me.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Of all the jobs we've agreed to do, this is certainly one of them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"You can say that again.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I guess I get why the one Boris guy can't do it but I don't quite see why we "
"have to go around asking everyone for him.  He lives here!  Anyway, you know "
"I'm okay with getting my hands dirty, if you want to go offer to help him out"
" I'll get busy with a scrubby.  I've cleaned worse things out of the "
"Foodplace washroom.  Hell, I've cleaned worse things out of the back of my "
"van when I was running for Amazon.\"  He gets a thousand-yard-stare for a "
"moment.  \"Let's not discuss this any more."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Thanks Liam, I knew I could count on you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"It's just a fetch job, right?  I'd say our best first bet would be to see if "
"Smokes up at the Free Merchant desk has one, and just shell out to get it "
"covered.  These guys are broke as heck, but we can easily make the cash back "
"by doing some good old fashioned scavenging."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Worth checking.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"&His voice comes out a bit softer and lower than usual.  \"This is just a sad"
" one, my friend.  I don't think we'll have any troubles with the delivery, "
"but it's so goddamn sad.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Nah, not me.  I hear they're hard to keep alive or something, and that makes "
"me nervous.  I was never really that much of a baker to be honest.  I love "
"the bread though, pretty excited to see what she makes.\"  He looks "
"thoughtful for a moment.  \"Depending on where the bakery is though, this "
"could be a heck of a job.  We should make sure we're ready to sneak past a "
"lot of zed to get to it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Or we could clear the area some other way.  I'd like your opinion on "
"something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"*grins.  \"Yeah, he sure is.  I never got the hang of the guitar, myself, but"
" I respect the journey.  It shouldn't be too hard to find one, right?  Lots "
"of people have them in their houses, or we could maybe loot a music store if "
"we want to get fancy.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"With your singing voice, I'm glad you never learned.  I'd like your opinion "
"on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Of course!  People need what comfort they can get, right?  I've always been "
"kinda spiritual, but I'm not the sort to put a label on it or anything.  I "
"don't have a clue where to find one though, I'm not sure I'd even recognize a"
" mosque if I saw one.  Do they stock books like that in normal stores?\"  He "
"frowns.  \"I feel like I should know this, but… well, no Wikipedia, right?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Cell phones were something else.  I'd like your opinion on a different thing "
"though."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"&He scratches his head.  \"No.  I guess a library or a bookstore.  I have a "
"feeling this is going to be a tough one though.  Maybe we could try like, "
"hardware stores?  Or school libraries?\"  He thinks a bit more.  \"Those seem"
" like our best bets to me, but I'm just guessing.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Thanks, man.  I'd like your opinion on a different thing though."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"This one sounds easy to me.  Let's just take apart some old machinery until "
"we find a good one."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Kinda wonder why she didn't just get us to get her a compressor, but she "
"probably has her reasons.\"  You notice a bit of an odd tone to his voice.  "
"\"Maybe we could take apart a big compressor for her, the tank would probably"
" be perfect."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Dude.  You have a crush on Jenny."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"*blushes, for some reason.  \"Uh, yeah.  Gun books, hey?  I guess we should "
"look in um, gun stores or libraries?  Or high school lockers, haha.  Oh, that"
" made me sad.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"*blushes.  \"Yeah we are.\"  He smiles dopily, apparently forgetting that "
"you'd asked for his thoughts."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Any opinions on the job itself?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Just wanted to point that out.  I'd like your opinion on a different thing "
"though."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Uh, right.  Maybe a gun store?  Or a library?  Or we could check high school "
"lockers, haha.  Oh, that made me sad."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"You've got it *bad*, dude.  I'd like your opinion on a different thing "
"though."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"&He looks at you, a bit surprised.  \"Yeah, of course.  I mean, that "
"situation they're in now is miserable, no matter how much we've helped folks "
"out there.  Can you imagine trying to be a young couple in that cramped "
"space?\"  He waggles his eyebrows suggestively.  \"They're tryin' to have a "
"*baby*, you know.  Gonna be hard in a bunkhouse.  Let's get them out to a "
"nice farm, some fresh air, and, *you* know.\"  He winks, to drive the point "
"far, far further home than necessary.  \"Let the magic happen, right?\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"That was unnecessarily clear.  Still, I'd like your opinion on a different "
"thing, somehow."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Seems pretty cut and dry to me.  Let's raid a few first aid kits.  I'm pretty"
" sure you can find that stuff in the basement of those government evac "
"shelters, for example."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Thanks.  I'd like your opinion on a different thing, though."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Kinda don't think she needs our help on this one, but she's in a bind I "
"guess.\"  He pauses.  \"No pun intended this time,\" he chuckles.  \"Anyway, "
"let's just find some spare fabric, choppy-choppy, and Bob's your uncle.\"  He"
" thinks for a moment.  \"Actually she'll probably want them disinfected, and "
"we should find her some tape too just to be on the safe side."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Fair enough.  I'd like your opinion on a different thing, though."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I admit, I haven't been paying attention to it, but I'm sure those things "
"must be around in half the medicine cabinets in the area, right?  Seems like "
"an easy looting job to me."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Good point.  I'd like your opinion on a different thing, though."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Worse things we could do for people than help them get haircuts,\" he shrugs."
"  \"No job too small, right?  Vanessa seems a bit cranky to me, but I'm not "
"judging.  Those folks are in a tough spot.  Maybe she'll turn suddenly nice "
"if we bring her the hair stuff she wants.\"  He grins.  \"I'm one hundred "
"percent sure that's what'll happen."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"That's my optimistic Liam.  I'd like your opinion on a different thing, "
"though."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"*laughs.  \"Look, Makayla is a trained professional, she knows what she's "
"doing with several kilograms of improvised explosives, doesn't she?\"  He "
"shrugs.  \"If not, let's just stay far away when she tests it.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"*blows out a long breath.  \"Well, my friend, I do think it's good to help "
"clean out some of the mess that's going on.  I'll be with you for it.  I'm "
"just not sure why you figure I'm the right guy for this job.  Shouldn't you "
"have, like, a cop or a soldier or something?  I'm a delivery driver.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Don't sell yourself short, Liam.  You've got my back."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I'll handle the tough parts, Liam.  You're there to cover my back, that's "
"all."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "In troubled times, we learn what sort of people we really are."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Meh.  What's a few bandits?  We'll flatten 'em."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Thanks.  You're right.  Okay, I can do this.\"  He shakes his shoulders and "
"limbers up, like a boxer preparing for a match.  \"Let's go."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Hold up Balboa, I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Oh, oh yeah that makes sense.  Okay, well, that's something I can do.  I'll "
"cover your back like it's never been covered before.  You and me like Calvin "
"and Hobbes, baby."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Thanks, Hooch.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"*sniffs the air around your head.  \"You been getting in the ganja?  No "
"judgment if so, but maybe you shouldn't be taking mercenary jobs while you're"
" high, y'know?\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Shut up, you're not my dad!  Anyway, I'd like your opinion on something else,"
" actually."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"*gives you some serious side-eye.  \"You okay?  This is serious shit, you're "
"making me kinda worried getting so gung-ho about it.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Don't worry, man.  Trust me, it'll be great.  Anyway, I'd like your opinion "
"on something else."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"You know, this sounds like it's gonna be some big exciting mystery whodunnit,"
" but I have this feeling if we just look around for someone who is acting "
"obviously and extremely suspicious it'll all fall apart at once."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I dunno, but compared to the last two missions for that guy, I gotta admit "
"I'm kinda stoked.  Robots?  This sounds *wicked*.  Do you think we're talking"
" more Terminator, or Wall-E?  Doesn't matter.  Robots!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Uh, well, we *did* meet that weird cyborg guy in the castle full of giant "
"robot dogs matching this exact description, right?  Tell me you remember "
"that.  Damn, it's worse saying it out loud.  I still can't really believe all"
" this stuff has really happened."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Oh, right, I remember that.  I'd like your opinion on something else, though."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"You know me my friend,\" he shrugs and grins at you.  \"I'd have said it was "
"some kinda cryptid or something *before* the world got flooded with monsters "
"and mutants.  Nowadays, I think I'd be more surprised if it was bandits "
"again.  As for how to deal with it, well, I guess we're getting pretty good "
"at dealing with this kind of thing now.  Let's handle it how we usually do: "
"with style."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Damn straight.  I'd like your opinion on something else, though."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I dunno,\" he points to your Marshal badge.  \"I guess if they give you a "
"shiny bit of metal you're not really an assassin for hire anymore, you're the"
" law.  Judge, jury, and executioner.\"  He scratches his neck and looks away "
"for a moment.  \"You know how I feel about all these high risk missions, but "
"we've gotten this far.  It's different now than when we started out.  I don't"
" think you need my advice, you know I'll have your back whatever happens."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I might not need it, but I still like to hear it.  I'd like your opinion on "
"something else, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Honestly my friend, this is the kinda stuff I hoped we'd be doing when we "
"offered to help these guys out.  Fresh air, great views, climbing on things "
"we'd have gotten in trouble for in the old days, maybe pushing a zombie off "
"the edge of a maintenance platform to see how big a splat it leaves at the "
"bottom.  Sounds wicked.  Let's bring a couple cold ones up to the top and "
"crack a brew while we survey the wasteland, hey?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Sounds like a great idea.  I'd like your opinion on something else, though."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, I'm with you there, it's some kind of weird map.  The smart thing to do"
" is probably avoid it, this is some really weird shit.  I've never been one "
"to do the smart thing though, myself.  Probably gonna have troubles sleeping "
"until I know what that thing is trying to lead us to."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "I know what you mean.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I just like, wanna back up a second.  We're trying to score drugs for a "
"cyborg so it can do surgery on you?  That's really where life's taking us, "
"now?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "…Yes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"*grins.  \"Okay, just wanted to clear that up.  I thought maybe I was having "
"some kind of psychotic break, glad it's at least mutual.  Anyway, first place"
" that comes to mind for that kinda stuff would be a hospital, but that's "
"suicide.  Maybe a pharmacy?  Would they have the right stuff?  Seems like a "
"stretch.  Maybe like, a vet clinic or a private surgery clinic might be "
"safer?  I'll level with you, I never got into anything harder than Mary Jane,"
" this is past my pay grade.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Something about this kinda rubs me the wrong way, my friend.  I don't know "
"what it is.  That Rubik guy seems nice enough but I feel like we're not "
"getting the whole story.  Just tread carefully, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Seems to me we could be wandering the area forever just looking for this "
"thing, to be honest.  I guess we could go up somewhere high like a radio "
"tower, maybe with some binoculars, and see if we can spot it?  Our best bet "
"might be to ask a few folks that have been around though, pool our resources."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"*leans in close, speaking softly, clearly trying to avoid notice from the "
"pizzaiolo.  \"Are you sure we should be hanging with this guy?  He's not "
"exactly all there, is he?  He reminds me a bit of Chris before things went "
"all chompy-chompy.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Chill, man.  It's just a little light arson, it'll be fine."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I hear you, but he's following us now and I don't know how else to get rid of"
" him."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I guess everything else is wrecked already anyway, what's one more burning "
"building?  And like, it *does* sound fun.  Let's just keep an eye on this "
"guy, he's a slice short of a full pie, if you catch my drift."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I knew you'd come around.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"True enough, and I don't wanna like, just *kill* him.  Well, I don't have "
"anything against a bonfire this season I suppose.  Let's just make sure "
"neither of us ends up lying face-down in a wood-fired oven, y'know?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"We're on the same page.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"No.\"  He stares at you, his eyes wild.  For a moment, you barely know the "
"man in front of you.  \"The things I've seen when I wore that mask… it "
"changes you.  It's a burden you can't truly understand unless you've borne "
"it.\"  He shudders, and becomes again the Liam you know.  \"Anyone who "
"chooses to keep wearing it after the end of the world… putting them down "
"would be a kindness, believe me."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Uh… okay.  I'd like your opinion on something else, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"*shrugs.  \"My thoughts on Murder Mario haven't changed much, but he hasn't "
"killed us yet.  I don't love the idea of just killing some other survivors "
"for him.  Foodperson doesn't count.\"  He shudders and takes a quick breath."
"  \"I have a funny feeling they won't let us talk them out of there, though."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"What if the cake is a lie?  Also do you really want to follow this guy back "
"to his house?  We both know that's not tomato sauce on his apron.  Don't eat "
"anything he cooks.\"  He shrugs, giving a nonplussed look.  \"Still, we've "
"committed actual murder for him multiple times now, so I guess I'm being a "
"bit of a hypocrite.  Let's party."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "You didn't have fun?  I think this whole adventure has been a…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I think it's worth it all, for the cake.  I'd like your opinion on something "
"else, actually."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"…SLICE!\"  Liam shouts along with you, then gives you a leaping high five "
"before dissolving into belly laughter.  \"OK fine, that makes all the murder "
"and arson worth it, you mad bastard."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "That, and the cake.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I feel like at some point we must have switched to playing Stardew Valley, "
"and I'm not quite sure when that happened.\"  He scratches his head.  \"Oh "
"well, let's just be sure to wear gumboots."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "And aprons.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"BUGHUNT!\"  Liam raises his arms over his head and grins.  \"BUUUG HUUUNT!\""
"  He mimes stomping on ants.  \"I'm doing my part!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "I did actually want your opinion on something though."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"It's all good, I never minded doing deliveries, especially with a friend for "
"company.  I guess we could try to find lumber in a lumberyard, right?  "
"Probably not a lot of zombies hanging out in lumber yards.  Or maybe we could"
" find an old barn and knock it down and take all the pieces.\"  He laughs.  "
"\"Or saw it ourselves from scratch, if you're feeling like a mad lad.  Make "
"sure we've got a vehicle that can fit it though, that much lumber ain't gonna"
" fit in a hatchback."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Something, something, wood pun, something something.  This is starting to "
"feel like Settlers of Catan, think they'll give us some sheep in return?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Six ropes?  I find it hard to believe these guys can't just get 'em "
"themselves, but, uh, OK I guess.  Maybe we could take some old seatbelts and "
"tie them together, or something.  It shouldn't be hard to find a few ropes "
"laying around."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Okay, wait, what?  One wood saw?  Why are you agreeing to this?  I like "
"deliveries as much as the next guy, but it's a *single wood saw*.  It's "
"starting to feel like you'll just agree to do anything anyone asks.\"  He "
"sighs.  \"No worries though I guess.  One time I delivered a single cold soda"
" to a guy living way out in the back woods.  Cost him seventy bucks.  People "
"are weird."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "A shovel?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Yeah, a shovel."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "A shovel."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
msgid "That's right."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "You're not joking."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "*stares at you for a few seconds.  \"At the shovel store, I guess.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"What now, a vegetable peele… oh, a smoker?  That's actually kinda legit I "
"guess.  Maybe we should hunt through peoples' backyards.  We could jump over "
"fences like in Shaun of the Dead!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I'm not a great expert on guns, to be honest.  I know how to shoot a bit, but"
" my focus was always on archery when I was a kid.  That sounds like a pretty "
"rare gun though, I think maybe we should see if we can find some old "
"collector rather than trying to raid a gun store?  Just a guess."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Nah, you got it.  This is the sort of job that never, ever went wrong, "
"certainly not in any one of a thousand TV tropes.  Let's go find an unknown "
"old man in a secluded cabin."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Glad we're on the same page.  I'd like your opinion on something else, "
"actually."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Hell yeah I am.  This guy seems nice.  Bunnies are cute.  This is the sort of"
" job I like, let's find him some logs.  We should be able to just hunt around"
" the woods for 'em, right?  Might need a hatchet or a saw."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"It sure does!  Is it blackberry season though?  I guess if they're not ripe, "
"we could check around abandoned kitchens and fridges, see if we can find some"
" that are still intact."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Nah.  Lapin's sweet.  I wanna smoke a joint with the bunny man.  If you ever "
"turn into a zombie I'm gonna come back here and settle down as an assistant "
"bunny tamer.  Hope you don't mind."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "No hard feelings.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"An anvil?  Where do you come up with this stuff?  Yeah, I met this guy, "
"Wile-E Coyote, he had a bunch of 'em."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I'll track him down.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I'm worried for these guys.  My gut tells me they're dealing with something "
"really dangerous.  Let's make sure we're packing heat, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Roger that.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"You can say that again.  This is some serious shit, my friend.  I know we've "
"been through a lot, but this might be the big one.  We need to make sure "
"we're ready for anything before we even consider going in there."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Roger that.  I'd like your opinion on something else, first."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"After the shit these poor bastards have gone through, picking some dandelions"
" for them seems kind of anticlimactic.  Still, I am a big fan of dandelion "
"wine."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Picking flowers in a field seems okay to me.  I don't mind helping Claire "
"out, she's a nice enough person.  Gotta say though, I get a bit of a weird "
"vibe off these guys.  They're so… I don't know.  It's like we walked into a "
"Norman Rockwell painting in the middle of the end of the world."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Bee bombs!  Kaboom!\"  He mimes an explosion with his hands.  \"Seriously "
"though it's a very versatile plant, we should get some seeds for ourselves."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I'll see what I can do.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"*laughs.  \"I was going to make a joke about herding cats, but yours is "
"better.  I was always more of a dog man myself, I don't know anything about "
"catching a feral cat.  Maybe we open a can of tuna?  Or is that a cliché?\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I'm still… 'feline' it out myself.  I'd like your opinion on something else, "
"actually."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Even if we work together it's gonna take a while to just find enough good "
"rocks lying around.  We'll probably want to get a shovel and dig around a bit"
" maybe?  Or break up bigger ones with a sledge.  I'm impressed at these guys,"
" keeping going after everything that's happened."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Even if we work together it's gonna take a while to just find enough good "
"rocks lying around.  We'll probably want to get a shovel and dig around a bit"
" maybe?  Or break up bigger ones with a sledge.  Something about this stuff "
"feels weird to me though.  Too pastoral for the apocalypse."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Yeah, I hear you.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Gathering sand sounds, honestly, sort of pleasant.  Like, meditative, you "
"know?  Maybe we find some batteries and get a bit of music going, smoke a "
"joint if you're so inclined, then fill some buckets of sand for Eddie to do "
"whatever the hell he's doing with it.  No zombies, no gunfire, just sand."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I believe he's making bricks.  I'd like your opinion on something else, "
"though."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I like a good, well defined physical job.  Let's go to the riverside!  I feel"
" like the odds of getting badly injured while gathering clay are sort of low."
"  Make sure to get some music going though, right?  Maybe bring some "
"refreshments?  And shovels."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"You do make it sound good.  I'd like your opinion on something else, "
"actually."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Big jars aren't really that uncommon.  Lots of people got super into canning "
"in the last few months before shit really hit the fan, like they did with "
"toilet paper a few years back.  Maybe a bit more reasonable, I guess, though "
"learning how to pickle meat probably didn't save anyone from zombies.  I bet "
"we can track down a few just by raiding houses, and if they're not empty "
"we'll just have to eat what's inside or something."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Do you need a snack, man?  Never mind.  I'd like your opinion on something "
"else, actually."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I'm sort of surprised they don't have plenty of wheat seeds of their own,\" "
"Liam shrugs.  \"What the hell do I know about farming though?  Nothing, "
"that's what.  Including having no idea about where to find wheat seeds, sorry"
" man.  I would have said 'on a farm' but we're on one and they're asking us, "
"so I just don't know what to think anymore.  My life is a shambles."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Fair enough.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"You know, it's a harmful stereotype that wolves are dangerous to humans.  Of "
"course I'm not afraid.\"  He smirks at you, then grins.  \"Except let's be "
"honest, this is probably going to be a giant monster zombie wolf or "
"something, right?  Let's go take the bastard down."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "That's the spirit.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Fast, unidentified monsters are killing the local wildlife, and we're going "
"to get 'em.\"  He looks thoughtful.  \"I'm pretty sure this was an episode of"
" the X-Files.  Or like, several episodes?  As long as we're Scully and Mulder"
" we'll be fine, but if we're the local cops coming in to investigate, we're "
"*toast*.  Just in case, let's make sure we've got our good gear."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Will do, Scully.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Funny you should ask, yeah I have.  My dad borrowed it from the library once "
"and I leafed through it.  So I guess we could try looking at a library?  I "
"got no better ideas, I was like thirteen, I don't remember what was in the "
"thing, and he got all pissy at me for checking it out anyway."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Well, yeah he does, because he's a man of discerning tastes.\"  Liam nods "
"approvingly.  \"Or because he wants something to prop his car up while he "
"changes the tire.  It's a big book, is what I'm saying.  We should make sure "
"we've got a copy for ourselves though, it's one of the prepper bibles."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Great info, thanks.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"*leans in close, speaking softly.  \"I do not say this lightly: this "
"motherfucker has *seen some shit*.  Look at that thousand-yard-stare.  We did"
" a good thing getting him out, but I don't know if he's ever really gonna be "
"*out*, you know?\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Do you think we can do anything for him?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "He'll suck it up.  We've all been through shit."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Scary stuff.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"We can get him home in one piece.  Get him back to his people.  I'd offer him"
" a drink or a toke, but I think they're like, Amish or something.  After "
"that, our best bet is to make ourselves scarce, to him we're always gonna be "
"the people he met in the tower.  He won't wanna be reminded of that."
msgstr ""
